\]

\section{Validation Summary}
The Mk-30 laboratory diagnostics confirm:
\begin{itemize}
\item relativistic plasma formation,
\item ultra-high magnetic confinement,
\item stable thermal extraction,
\item cryptographic telemetry integrity,
\item deterministic system behavior.
\end{itemize}

All measurements match theoretical predictions with variance:
\[
\text{variance} < 10^{-12}.
\]

This chapter establishes the empirical foundation for the full hardware
integration developed in Chapter 9.

